{
  "version": "2025.10",
  "description": "Aqua theme — glossy translucent gel.\n\nLean value-overrides — themes override VALUES, never anatomy. Captures the\naqua gel with a handful of levers: rounder controls, a glossy top-half sheen\n(--a63-control-gloss, the shared capability) + specular rim + soft colored drop\nshadow, a wide focus halo, and a faint blue surface tint. The blue tint is\ninherent to aqua (fixed b1), independent of the brand accent.\n\nGel material is theme-private under this selector. Shared blur ladder stops\n(--blur-lg) come from foundation; the 20px gel blur is skin-only.\n\nBrand-tinted halo removed: weather keeps the shared aqua drop so the tile\n   sits on the same elevation as every other widget.",
